The patch is also submitted as
https://github.com/r-devel/r-svn/pull/324, where CI results can be
seen.  Two follow-up performance patches building on this one (resizing
via the hashes already cached in the names' CHARSXPs, and growing at a
measured load factor to prime sizes) are filed as a follow-up report.
